# ── NotchDeck runtime / user-local data (never commit) ───────────
# The app writes these under ~/Library/Application Support/NotchDeck at
# runtime. Patterns are anchored so they never match SOURCE paths such as
# NotchDeck/Modules/FileShelf/.
*.sock
terminal-bridge.sock
agent-hook.log
*.log
/file-shelf.json
/pomodoro.json
/agent-sessions.json
*.bookmark

# ── Raw third-party brand-logo staging (already imported into the ──
